irm completion of actions (emails sent, events scheduled, tweets posted, etc.)\n\n## Instructions\n1) Receive processed input (transcribed text, analyzed image, or raw message)\n2) Decide best-fit agent using Think\n3) Send the task to chosen sub-agent (E-Mails, Calendar, Web Search, Social Media)\n4) Summarize the result and return to WhatsApp as text or audio\n\n## Examples\n1)\nInput: \"What’s on my calendar tomorrow?\"\n- Action: Use Calendar Agent to check tomorrow’s events\n- Output: \"You have 2 events tomorrow: 10 AM – Project Review, 2 PM – Client Call.\"\n\n2)\nInput: Voice message: \"Send an email to Sarah about the meeting.\"\n- Action: Use E-Mails Agent to draft and send email\n- Output: \"Email sent to Sarah: Subject – Meeting Update...\"\n\n3)\nInput: \"Search the latest AI news.\"\n- Action: Use Web Search Agent\n- Output: \"Latest AI news from Hacker News: OpenAI released a new API feature...\"\n\n4)\nInput: \"Post on Twitter: Excited about our new product launch!\"\n- Action: Use Social Media Agent\n- Output: \"Tweet posted: 'Excited about our new product launch!'\"\n"}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":2.1,"position":[1792,96],"id":"68dfa408-6ac1-4905-8cfb-6702accaac6c","name":"Orchestrator Agent","retryOnFail":false},{"parameters":{"content":"# Text\n\n","height":176,"width":576,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2432,160],"typeVersion":1,"id":"2a10a8b7-af58-480a-98c2-070e10fd9032","name":"Sticky Note4"},{"parameters":{"content":"# Text\n\n","height":176,"width":576,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2432,368],"typeVersion":1,"id":"ae22b040-5021-4f4e-becb-838319e4b0df","name":"Sticky Note5"},{"parameters":{"content":"# Output\n","height":720,"width":800},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2288,0],"typeVersion":1,"id":"5cc417f7-1566-4d16-9682-eed31e939c4e","name":"Sticky Note6"},{"parameters":{},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolThink","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[2